text.section:
The description of each cigarette listed in the certification shall include:

The brand;


The style;


The length in millimeters;


The circumference in millimeters;


The flavor, if applicable;


Whether filter or nonfilter;


A package description, such as soft pack or box;


The mark approved in accordance with § 9.1-212;


The name, address, and telephone number of the laboratory, if different than the manufacturer that conducted the test; and


The date that the testing occurred.
